<title>HONG KONG: Japan mulling regional yen repo accords - Sakakibara.</title>
<headline>Japan mulling regional yen repo accords - Sakakibara.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan was considering the possibility of yen repo agreements, similar to recent regional dollar repo accords, if other countries deemed them necessary, Eisuke Sakakibara, director general of the Finance Ministry's International Finance Bureau said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
